"x":0,"y":0},{"fill":"none","font_color":"000000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":24.0,"h":263,"id":"00015a","text":"(4)将紫色石蕊溶液滴入新制氯水中，溶液显红色，起作用的微粒是_______，过一会儿，溶液的颜色褪去，起作用的微粒是________。\r(5)向氯水中滴加AgNO3溶液有白色沉淀生成，证明氯水中含有的粒子是________。\r(6)氯水经光照后，颜色逐渐消失，并放出的气体是______，溶液的酸性_______(填“增强”“不变”或“减弱”)\r(7)将Cl2通入水中，溶液中具有氧化性的微粒是___________________。\r","type":"shape","w":934,"x":0,"y":259},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":63,"id":"00015b","text":"Cl2\r","type":"shape","w":134,"x":708,"y":97},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":84,"id":"00015c","text":"H+\r","type":"shape","w":95,"x":759,"y":148},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":84,"id":"00015d","text":"HClO\r","type":"shape","w":179,"x":708,"y":198},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":63,"id":"00015e","text":"H+\r","type":"shape","w":85,"x":724,"y":259},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":84,"id":"00015f","text":"HClO\r","type":"shape","w":179,"x":410,"y":282},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":84,"id":"000160","text":"Cl—\r","type":"shape","w":135,"x":767,"y":319},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":84,"id":"000161","text":"O2\r","type":"shape","w":85,"x":548,"y":361},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"微软雅黑","font_size":32.0,"h":80,"id":"000162","text":"增强\r","type":"shape","w":117,"x":754,"y":371},{"fill":"none","font_color":"FF0000","font_name":"Times New Roman","font_size":34.0,"h":151,"id":"000163","text":"Cl2、ClO—、HClO\r\r","type":"shape","w":321,"x":502,"y":440}],"version":0}
